    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>But that's the thing, there is no \"rebuilding.\" It’s not like I just lost a job. My entire brain is wired around this one thing and now that’s dead. It feels like I'm just a hollow shell pretending to be a person. I look in the mirror and there's nothing behind my eyes anymore. It's hard to even see a point in waking up tomorrow if I'm just going to be this... nothing.",
